ind":"announcement","title":"Persistent Loot & Deeper Basement","summary":"The basement keeps growing. 10 levels to dig through now, a shop where everything you drag out of the mansion turns into money and better gear, and a quest system to send you back down. Plus your progress finally saves. New FeaturesThe basement now has multiple levels.New quest system. Take jobs, complete them, get paid.A shop. Sell the loot you drag out of the mansion, buy better gear before you go back down.Save & load. Your run persists now. Inventory, money, gear durability and the deepest f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T09:10:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951302546","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4483650-1840944183774928","game_id":"steam-4483650","kind":"announcement","title":"Co-op interaction, item pickups and join-by-code fixes","summary":"Fixed an error that fired on every room you entered after your first dungeon run of a session. Room-change audio and room tracking no longer stop updating on your second and later runs.The game no longer holds on to rooms from a previous run after you return to the mansion and start a new one.Fixed a bug that could kill interaction for the rest of a run — no \"E\" prompt on doors, items, clocks or anything else, with no way to recover short of leaving. The trigger was co-op: if a teammate finished","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T20:04:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183774928","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4483650-1835871199303689","game_id":"steam-4483650","kind":"announcement","title":"Co-op Is Live — Survive The Clownhouse Beta Together","summary":"Co-op Has Arrived — Now in Beta! The wait is over: The Clownhouse now has co-op, and it's playable right now in the beta. Sneak, loot, hide, and escape the mansion with friends instead of going it alone. The clown doesn't care how many of you there are... and that's exactly the problem. How to Get In Click \"Request Access\" on the store page. You'll be notified as we open up more spots. Once you're in, grab some friends and dive into co-op. Spots are limited, so request access now to be among the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-18T10:08:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199303689","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4483650-1832700592791987","game_id":"steam-4483650","kind":"announcement","title":"Open Beta Now Live — Sneak, Loot, Survive (May 15–31)","summary":"🎪 The Clownhouse Open Beta is Live!For two weeks only, you can step inside the cursed mansion and try The Clownhouse completely free.The clown is waiting. Are you brave enough to break in?📅 When?May 15 – May 31, 2026After May 31, the beta closes and the next time you'll see The Clownhouse will be at Early Access launch.🎮 What You'll PlayThe Open Beta includes the full core experience:Break into a procedurally generated mansion through the giant clown's mouthSneak, hide, and loot — no weapons, no","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-15T13:24:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592791987","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4483650":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:32:59Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:32:58Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_a